| `--card` | ❌ **NOT DEFINED** | — | — |
| `--background` | ❌ **NOT DEFINED** | — | — |
| `--foreground` | ✅ **DEFINED** | Light: `var(--color-dark)` / Dark: `var(--color-light)` | Used in Button, Breadcrumb |
| `--border` | ❌ **NOT DEFINED** | — | Breadcrumb uses `--border-window-color` or `--border-element-color` instead |
