## Summary

| Aspect | Details |
|--------|---------|
| **Tailwind Usage** | ✅ All components use Tailwind utilities (e.g., `flex`, `items-center`, `text-xs`, `mb-8`) + custom spacing/size vars via `@theme` |
| **CSS Variables** | Use **semantic color variables** (`--base`, `--window`, `--foreground`, `--accent`) that change with light/dark theme and level context |
| **Architecture** | Components delegate styling to **CVA (class-variance-authority)** for variant management (`buttonGroupItemVariants`) |
| **Custom Variables** | Extensive use of custom properties for **spacing** (`--spacing-*`, `--size-*`), **colors** (`--hover-*`, `--active-*`), and **cursors** |
| **No shadcn/ui vars** | The codebase does **NOT** use standard shadcn/ui CSS variables like `--card`, `--background`, `--border` |

